sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant GH as GitHub PR
    participant AI as ai-review.mjs
    participant DS as DeepSeek API
    participant GHAPI as GitHub API/gh CLI

    GH->>AI: pull_request (opened/synchronize)
    AI->>GHAPI: GET /pulls/{n}/comments (找 ai-review-bot 评论)
    alt 已有同 SHA 的 AI 评论
        AI-->>GH: 跳过（防重复）
    else 需审
        AI->>GHAPI: GET /pulls/{n}/files (diff)
        AI->>GHAPI: GET /pulls/{n}/commits (拼功能清单)
        AI->>DS: POST /chat/completions (精简上下文)
        DS-->>AI: {issues:[{category,severity,file,line,suggestion}]}
        AI->>GHAPI: POST /pulls/{n}/comments (分类评论文本 + Reviewed:<sha>)
        AI-->>GH: 建议性评论（非阻断，CI neutral/success）
    end
